# PLATOON-DEPTH ABLATION — LANE A (of 2). Plan: docs/next-cycles.md,
# "The platoon-depth ablation cycle" (owner-decided 2026-08-18).
#
# Job 1 is the NEUTRALITY RE-DERIVATION: platoon at seed 12 on the tree that
# added the arms (d439164). The pre-flight will correctly flag it as a
# duplicate of platoon_v8 — that is the measurement: this lane launches with
# FORCE=1 precisely so the digests can say whether the registration moved
# anything. If baseline.py's reproduction table does NOT show
# platoon_v10_seed12 == platoon_v8 when it lands, STOP LANE B and diagnose —
# the additive claim failed and that is the finding.
#
# The remaining jobs are new configs; FORCE=1 skips their pre-flight too,
# which is accepted here because the arm scenarios did not exist before this
# tree and can have no prior same-config runs.
platoon_v10_seed12         --scenario platoon         --total-steps 3000000 --seed 12
platoon_nomask_v1_seed12   --scenario platoon_nomask  --total-steps 3000000 --seed 12
platoon_nomask_v2_seed13   --scenario platoon_nomask  --total-steps 3000000 --seed 13
platoon_nomask_v3_seed14   --scenario platoon_nomask  --total-steps 3000000 --seed 14
